n":false},"body":"Adds an editor setting for automatically switching workspace from 2D/3D (this is the current behavior) based on the selected nodes type in the Scene Tree; it defaults to true/toggled but allows users the option to uncheck/ not switch the workspace based on whether you have selected 2d or 3d node in the scene tree. This is useful if you are working on scenes that are mixed 2d/3d like with Viewports and TextureRects etc... as it can be quite disorientating when it auto switches the workspace.\r\n\r\nNote this would likely be for Godot 4.7; I cant see a proposal for this, however this proposal is very similar https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13379 \r\n\r\nAnd some forum discussions:\r\nhttps://godotforums.org/d/42970-how-to-disable-the-auto-tab-switching-when-click-a-node3d-in-scene-tree/3\r\nhttps://godotforums.org/d/36666-editor-view-changes-from-2d-to-3d-when-i-select-a-3d-node\r\n\r\nVideo of feature:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/339c7e08-accd-4b4c-8a89-5d36c4f41772\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MD